  "description": "**Level I — Beginner.** Kettlebell Lifestyle is a 9-week personalised, multi-level kettlebell and wellness program. Level I teaches the swing variations, squats, presses, cleans and combination movements from the ground up — alongside morning routines, personalised stretching, bodyweight warm-ups and follow-along workouts.\n\n**Level II — Intermediate.** Level II picks up where the Beginner program ends. Denser conditioning, double-bell work, snatch progressions and complexes — with the same morning routine, warm-up and stretching structure holding it all together.",
